      "message": "For pviommu, we have a use case to have a read only sharing of pages with host. This is to share the translation structures such that host can read(for virt_to_phys, debugfs usage etc) but not modify the page. I have cooked up a temporary api in the pviommu patchset: aosp/3788748. But it would be great if you could consider that in this series as well :-)",
